# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide shows how to use the [SBD eigensolver](https://github.com/Qiskit/sbd-eigensolver-python) as an alternative selected configuration interaction (SCI) solver to diagonalize larger fermionic problems beyond what the default PySCF solver can support. SBD (Selected Basis Diagonalization) runs in-process, is parallelized with MPI, and offers both CPU and CUDA backends. For information on how to install and use it, see the [SBD documentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/sbd-eigensolver-python).\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menunjukkan cara memakai [eigensolver SBD](https://github.com/Qiskit/sbd-eigensolver-python) sebagai solver selected configuration interaction (SCI) alternatif untuk mendiagonalisasi masalah fermionik yang lebih besar daripada yang bisa didukung solver PySCF default. SBD (Selected Basis Diagonalization) berjalan in-process, diparalelkan dengan MPI, dan menyediakan backend CPU maupun CUDA. Untuk informasi cara menginstal dan memakainya, lihat [dokumentasi SBD](https://github.com/Qiskit/sbd-eigensolver-python).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SBD compiles a C++ extension against the MPI and BLAS libraries available on the machine, so you must install both before you install the `sbd` extra:\n"
msgstr "SBD mengompilasi ekstensi C++ terhadap pustaka MPI dan BLAS yang tersedia di mesin, jadi kamu harus menginstal keduanya sebelum menginstal extra `sbd`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because `solve_sci_batch` already matches the solver interface that `diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian` expects, you can pass it directly to `sci_solver` after you bind its configuration options with `functools.partial`. To run on a CUDA-capable GPU instead of the CPU, pass `device_config=DeviceConfig.gpu()` from `sbd.device_config`.\n"
msgstr "Karena `solve_sci_batch` sudah sesuai dengan antarmuka solver yang diharapkan `diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian`, kamu bisa meneruskannya langsung ke `sci_solver` setelah mengikat opsi konfigurasinya dengan `functools.partial`. Untuk berjalan di GPU yang mendukung CUDA, bukan di CPU, teruskan `device_config=DeviceConfig.gpu()` dari `sbd.device_config`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more details on the SQD code used in this example, see the [chemistry Hamiltonian tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization).\n"
msgstr "Untuk detail lebih lanjut tentang kode SQD yang dipakai dalam contoh ini, lihat [tutorial Hamiltonian kimia](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization).\n"
